[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1mScenario 1: Async notification dispatch endpoint\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  \u001b[90mAn e-commerce platform is building a post-checkout flow. When a customer completes a purchase, a backend service needs t...\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  \u001b[1mBaseline (without context)\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.006, "o", "  Check                           Score         \r\n  ----------------------------------------------\r\n  Async context manager           \u001b[31m0/12\u001b[39m  \u001b[31m(0%)\u001b[39m    \r\n  NotificationConfig from env     \u001b[33m7/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[33m(70%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  Message keyword arguments       \u001b[33m4/8\u001b[39m  \u001b[33m(50%)\u001b[39m    \r\n  Uses dispatch not send          \u001b[31m0/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[31m(0%)\u001b[39m    \r\n  Delivery confirmation check     \u001b[31m0/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[31m(0%)\u001b[39m    \r\n  Logs message_id                 \u001b[31m0/8\u001b[39m  \u001b[31m(0%)\u001b[39m     \r\n  DispatchError caught explicitly \u001b[31m0/12\u001b[39m  \u001b[31m(0%)\u001b[39m    \r\n  No 500 on DispatchError         \u001b[32m10/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m \r\n  notification_sent in response   \u001b[31m0/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[31m(0%)\u001b[39m    \r\n  No v2 API usage                 \u001b[31m0/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[31m(0%)\u001b[39m    \r\n  ----------------------------------------------\r\n  \u001b[1mTotal\u001b[22m                           \u001b[31m21/100\u001b[39m  \u001b[31m(21%)\u001b[39m \r\n  "]
[0.000, "o", "  \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  \u001b[1mWith context\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "  Check                           Score           \r\n  ------------------------------------------------\r\n  Async context manager           \u001b[32m12/12\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  NotificationConfig from env     \u001b[32m10/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  Message keyword arguments       \u001b[32m8/8\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m     \r\n  Uses dispatch not send          \u001b[32m10/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  Delivery confirmation check     \u001b[32m10/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  Logs message_id                 \u001b[32m8/8\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m     \r\n  DispatchError caught explicitly \u001b[32m12/12\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  No 500 on DispatchError         \u001b[32m10/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  notification_sent in response   \u001b[32m10/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  No v2 API usage                 \u001b[32m10/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  ------------------------------------------------\r\n  \u001b[1mTotal\u001b[22m                           \u001b[32m100/100\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m \r\n  \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1mScenario 2: Retry logic with exponential backoff\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  \u001b[90mA SaaS platform's password reset flow uses the pidge notification library to deliver reset-link emails. The infrastructu...\u001b[39m\r\n  \r\n  \u001b[1mBaseline (without context)\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "  Check                           Score         \r\n  ----------------------------------------------\r\n  Retry up to 3 attempts          \u001b[32m12/12\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m \r\n  Exponential backoff sleep       \u001b[32m12/12\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m \r\n  asyncio.sleep for backoff       \u001b[32m8/8\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  No retry on permanent errors    \u001b[32m10/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m \r\n  DispatchError caught            \u001b[31m0/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[31m(0%)\u001b[39m    \r\n  Logs failure after retries      \u001b[32m8/8\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  Async context manager lifecycle \u001b[31m0/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[31m(0%)\u001b[39m    \r\n  Result check after success      \u001b[31m0/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[31m(0%)\u001b[39m    \r\n  Logs message_id on success      \u001b[31m0/8\u001b[39m  \u001b[31m(0%)\u001b[39m     \r\n  notification_sent in response   \u001b[31m0/12\u001b[39m  \u001b[31m(0%)\u001b[39m    \r\n  ----------------------------------------------\r\n  \u001b[1mTotal\u001b[22m                           \u001b[33m50/100\u001b[39m  \u001b[33m(50%)\u001b[39m \r\n    \r\n  \u001b[1mWith context\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "  Check                           Score           \r\n  ------------------------------------------------\r\n  Retry up to 3 attempts          \u001b[32m12/12\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  Exponential backoff sleep       \u001b[32m12/12\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  asyncio.sleep for backoff       \u001b[32m8/8\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m     \r\n  No retry on permanent errors    \u001b[32m10/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  DispatchError caught            \u001b[32m10/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  Logs failure after retries      \u001b[32m8/8\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m     \r\n  Async context manager lifecycle \u001b[32m10/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  Result check after success      \u001b[32m10/10\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  Logs message_id on success      \u001b[32m8/8\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m     \r\n  notification_sent in response   \u001b[32m12/12\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m   \r\n  ------------------------------------------------\r\n  \u001b[1mTotal\u001b[22m                           \u001b[32m100/100\u001b[39m  \u001b[32m(100%)\u001b[39m \r\n  \r\n\u001b[1mScenario 3: v2 to v3 migration\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  \u001b[90mA logistics company's shipping notification service was built two years ago and has been running reliably in production....\u001b[39m\r\n  \r\n  \u001b[1mBaseline (without context)\u001b[22m\r\n"]
